[
  {
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "dialogueText": "Di dunia dimana manusia super menjadi pelindung utama di bumi, terdapat sebuah kota bernama Ardaya. Di antara manusia super yang ada, terdapat satu keluarga yang terkenal akan kehebatannya. Sang Bapak, Agung, memiliki kekuatan fisik yang tidak manusiawi. Sementara Sang Ibu, Sri, memiliki kemampuan untuk bergerak dengan kecepatan suara.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung.png",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "dialogueText": "Dapat dikatakan bahwa Agung & Sri menjadi tonggak utama dalam menjaga perdamaian kota ini. Di luar kehidupannya sebagai pahlawan super, Agung dan Sri memiliki warung kopi sebagai sumber pemasukan utama mereka.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "dialogueText": "Mereka dikaruniai seorang anak laki-laki bernama Raden. Ia mewarisi kekuatan super Bapaknya dan kecepatan Ibunya. Namun, Raden merasa kekuatannya ini adalah beban, sehingga ia memilih untuk bermalas-malasan hingga dewasa...",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "dialogueText": "[Di suatu sore hari yang normal, di sebuah Warung Kopi sederhana dengan papan nama “Warkop Jagoan”. Terlihat sebuah keluarga dan seorang karyawati sedang beres-beres.]",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Bapak",
    "dialogueText": "Akhirnya beres juga hari ini. Raden, bapak minta tolong bersihkan halaman di depan ya, kita sudah mau closing untuk hari ini!",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/bapak",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Raden",
    "dialogueText": "(Dengan wajah mengerut) Tck, Baik pak.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/raden",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "left",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "dialogueText": "[Raden mulai membersihkan halaman dengan ekspresi murung. Setelah selesai, Bulan, sang pegawai, menghampirinya dan memberinya segelas air.]",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Bulan",
    "dialogueText": "Capek ya mas, ini diminum dulu airnya?",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/heroines/sprite/bulan",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Raden",
    "dialogueText": "Makasih mbak Bulan. Ya begitu lah mbak, setiap hari disuruh ini itu pasti capek lah.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/raden",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "left",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Bulan",
    "dialogueText": "(Tertawa kecil) Namanya juga usaha mas, pasti lah capek. Yang terpenting hari ini sudah selesai dan mas Raden bisa istirahat sepuasnya di rumah, Kerja bagus ya.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/heroines/sprite/bulan",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Raden",
    "dialogueText": "Iya iya, kamu juga.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/raden",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "left",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "dialogueText": "[Dari dalam warkop, Sang Ibu membawa nampan berisi piring dan gelas kotor dan menghampiri mereka berdua.]",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ibu",
    "dialogueText": "Sudah selesai nak bersih-bersihnya?",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/ibu",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Raden",
    "dialogueText": "Iya bu, lihat saja sendiri. Semua sudah aku bersihkan sampai berkilau.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/raden",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "left",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ibu",
    "dialogueText": "Yasudah kalau begitu, setelah ini bantu bapakmu sana di dalam.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/ibu",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "dialogueText": "[Raden menggerutu dan berdiri dengan enggan. Melihat perilaku anaknya, Sri lantas bertanya.]",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ibu",
    "dialogueText": "Nak, ada apa? kok mrengut gitu?",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/ibu",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Raden",
    "dialogueText": "Raden capek bu, hari-hari gini-gini aja. Apalagi, Raden ngerasa kekuatan Raden ini ga berguna, sia-sia dah rasanya!",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/raden",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "left",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ibu",
    "dialogueText": "Lho kenapa kepikiran gitu nak? Kan keren, kamu bisa jadi superhero kayak di film-film kesukaanmu gitu.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/ibu",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Raden",
    "dialogueText": "Iya sihh buu, tapi superhero apa yang setiap hari kerjaannya bersih-bersih warung, bikin kopi, sama masak makanan. Kalau begini caranya, aku merasa kalau kekuatanku sia-sia bu..",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/raden",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "left",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ibu",
    "dialogueText": "Menjadi pahlawan tidak selamanya tentang melawan musuh-musuh jahat nak. Terkadang hal seperti ini juga bisa membantumu menjadi lebih bijak dan kuat. Suatu hari kamu bakal tau nak.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/ibu",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "dialogueText": "[Ibu terdiam sejenak dan tersenyum kecil kepada Raden.]",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ibu",
    "dialogueText": "Ibu jadi inget salah satu kutipan dari film superhero yang ibu lihat.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/ibu",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Raden",
    "dialogueText": "Apa tuh bu?",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/raden",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "left",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ibu",
    "dialogueText": "“With Great Power Comes Great Responsibility’ gitu deh pokoknya!",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/ibu",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Raden",
    "dialogueText": "Widihh jago juga bahasa Inggris ibu.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/raden",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "left",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ibu",
    "dialogueText": "(Tertawa dan tersenyum) Bisa aja kamu nak…",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/ibu",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Bulan",
    "dialogueText": "Mungkin ada benarnya juga bu, bisa saja kekuatan itu akan bermanfaat di saat yang tepat.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/heroines/sprite/bulan",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ibu",
    "dialogueText": "Betul itu….Eh Bulan? Kok belum pulang kamu?",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/ibu",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Bulan",
    "dialogueText": "Iya Bu, kalau begitu saya pamit pulang dulu ya. Warkopnya sudah saya bereskan dan sudah saya rapihkan juga.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/heroines/sprite/bulan",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ibu",
    "dialogueText": "Terima kasih ya Bulan, sampai ketemu besok.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/ibu",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "dialogueText": "[Tiba-tiba, terdengar suara gemuruh dari ujung jalan yang membuat kaca dan gelas Warkop bergetar.]",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Raden",
    "dialogueText": "Lho bu, ada apa ini?",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/raden",
    "rightPortrait": "",
    "speakerPosition": "left",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Ibu",
    "dialogueText": "Ibu kurang tau nak, perasaan ibu jadi tidak enak.",
    "emotionIndex": 0,
    "background": "ui/background/VN_Warung",
    "voiceClip": "",
    "leftPortrait": "",
    "rightPortrait": "characters/fix/mainCharacters/sprite/ibu",
    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Bulan",
    "dialogueText": "Mas Raden, Bu, apa itu?",
