    "speakerPosition": "right",
    "choices": [],
    "actionType": 0
  },
  {
    "speaker": "Bulan",
    "dialogueText": "(Masih dalam keadaan panik) I-Iya bu, Saya tunggu disini. Hati-hati pak, bu.",
